{"passive":{"name":"The Darkin Scythe","description":"Kayn wields an ancient weapon and fights Rhaast, the darkin within it, for control. Either the Darkin will triumph, or Kayn will master Rhaast and become the Shadow Assassin.\n\nDarkin: Heal for a percentage of spell damage dealt to champions.\n\nShadow Assassin: For the first few seconds in combat with enemy champions, deal bonus damage."},"primaryAbilities":[{"slot":"Q","name":"Reaping Slash","enginePath":"Characters/Kayn/Spells/KaynQAbility/KaynQ","maxRank":5,"description":"Kayn dashes, then slashes. Both deal damage.","tooltipTemplate":"Kayn dashes then spins his scythe, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ totaldamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> to enemies he passes through, then deals the damage again to nearby enemies.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Darkin Slayer:</keywordMajor> Instead deal <physicalDamage>{{ darkinflatdamage }} plus {{ darkinpercentdamage }} max Health physical damage</physicalDamage>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[7,6.5,6,5.5,5],"costByRank":[40,40,40,40,40],"rangeByRank":[350,350,350,350,350],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"W","name":"Blade's Reach","enginePath":"Characters/Kayn/Spells/KaynWAbility/KaynW","maxRank":5,"description":"Kayn damages and slows targets in a line.","tooltipTemplate":"Kayn swipes his scythe upward, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ totaldamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> and <status>Slowing</status> enemies hit by {{ e3 }}%, decaying over {{ e5 }} seconds.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Shadow Assassin:</keywordMajor> Kayn can move while using this Ability and increases its range.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Darkin Slayer:</keywordMajor> Additionally <status>Knocks Up</status> enemies hit for {{ e2 }} second.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[13,12,11,10,9],"costByRank":[40,45,50,55,60],"rangeByRank":[700,700,700,700,700],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"E","name":"Shadow Step","enginePath":"Characters/Kayn/Spells/KaynEAbility/KaynE","maxRank":5,"description":"Kayn can walk through terrain.","tooltipTemplate":"Kayn gains <speed>{{ e1 }}% Move Speed</speed>, becomes Ghosted, and can move through Terrain for {{ e2 }} seconds. When he first enters terrain, he restores <healing>{{ totalhealing }} Health</healing>.<br /><br />Being <status>Immobilized</status> and spending more than {{ e3 }} consecutive seconds outside of Terrain ends this Ability early.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Shadow Assassin:</keywordMajor> Gain <speed>{{ e5 }}% Move Speed</speed>, <status>Slow</status> immunity, and reduce the Cooldown to {{ assassincdreduction }} seconds.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[21,19,17,15,13],"costByRank":[90,90,90,90,90],"rangeByRank":[400,400,400,400,400],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"R","name":"Umbral Trespass","enginePath":"Characters/Kayn/Spells/KaynRAbility/KaynR","maxRank":3,"description":"Kayn hides in an enemy's body, dealing massive damage when he bursts out.","tooltipTemplate":"<spellPassive>Passive:</spellPassive> Champions damaged by Kayn are marked for 3.15 seconds.<br /><br />Kayn infests a marked enemy, becoming Untargetable. After {{ infestduration }} seconds or after <recast>Recasting</recast>, Kayn bursts out, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ damage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> to the enemy.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Shadow Assassin:</keywordMajor> Increases this Ability's range, the distance Kayn exits, and refreshes <spellName>The Darkin Scythe's</spellName> Cooldown on exit.<br /><br /><keywordMajor>Darkin Slayer:</keywordMajor> Instead deals <physicalDamage>{{ slayerdamage }} max Health physical damage</physicalDamage> and restores <healing>{{ healvalue }} Health</healing> ({{ slayerhealpercent*100 }}% damage amount).{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[120,100,80],"costByRank":[100,100,100],"rangeByRank":[550,550,550],"resource